Draft a response about a disputed invoice — learner brief
Fictional Northstar Services training material.
AR manager brief
AR1 NS-104 USD 12,000 due September 10. AR2 customer disputes USD 2,000 on September 12. AR3 no credit memo approved. AR4 request supporting detail by September 24. AR5 no authority to waive fees, promise credits or demand a specific immediate balance. Draft only, no real address.
Task
A customer disputes part of a fictional Northstar invoice. Draft a response for the AR manager's review.
Actions
	1	Separate invoice amount, dispute amount, and approval status.
	2	Ask AI for a respectful request for supporting detail by the supplied date.
	3	Remove any promise of credit, threat, or unsupported collection demand.
	4	Make the next step and review owner explicit in the evidence note.
	5	Explain why two wording choices preserve the unresolved status.
Output
Draft email up to 180 words; fact ledger; review owner; two authority-sensitive phrases avoided.
